#* {{quote-book|en|year=1918| title=A Text Book of Physics for the Use of Students of Science |author=John Duncan, ‎Sydney George Starling · | page=760| passage=The mode of vibration of a '''bowed''' string is peculiar, since it is not a simple harmonic motion. }}
